#: ../../technical/articles/111-core-configuration-profile-selection-and-durable-writes.md:16
msgid ""
"The configuration validators derive the database URL from the selected "
"profile’s bucket, or use a root fallback only when no profile is "
"selected; both routes check for a retired product database before "
"composing a path. Explicit path overrides are respected, while unset "
"derived output locations are rooted under the configured local storage "
"root. Separate pointer observation code treats the active-profile pointer"
" as a settings-cache input, so constructing new settings after "
"login/logout sees the changed profile coordinate instead of reusing a "
"stale database route. Validators also normalize blank optional secrets "
"and paths, require specific authentication URL placeholders, and enforce "
"canonical Cl@ve DNI-date syntax. _config_runtime.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/_config_runtime.py`) _config_validation.py "
